# AGS Repo - .gitignore
# SECURITY: Only the dashboard HTML goes to GitHub.
# All raw MD/CSV files stay LOCAL ONLY (Google Drive).
# The dashboard is self-contained — all content is baked in during build.

# Ignore everything first
*

# Then whitelist ONLY what we need public
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Dashboard files (the only public-facing assets)
!dashboard/
!dashboard/dashboard_template.html
!dashboard/crm.html
!dashboard/build.ps1
!dashboard/push.ps1
!dashboard/index.html
!dashboard/existing_names.txt

# EVERYTHING ELSE stays local — never pushed to GitHub
# This includes:
# - AGS_MASTER_OUTREACH.md (730 prospects)
# - AGS_MASTER_OUTREACH.csv
# - AGS_COLD_CALL_SCRIPTS.md
# - AGS_EMAIL_OUTBOUND.md
# - AGS_LINKEDIN_OUTBOUND.md
# - AGS_WHY_AGS_ONEPAGER.md
# - AGS_STRATEGIC_PLAN.md
# - AGS_COMPETITIVE_ANALYSIS.md
# - AGS_PHASE6_PROSPECTING.md
# - AGS_MAX_B2B_PLAYBOOK.md
# - AGS_MASTER_TODO.md
# - STRATEGY_RULES.md
# - AGS_CASH_FLOW_AUDIT.md
# - All other .md, .csv, .py, .zip files
